---
const guards = [
  { title: "Allowlist, not guesswork", body: "Only known generated folders count, and only beside a real project marker." },
  { title: "Nothing preselected", body: "Every folder starts unchecked. You choose what goes." },
  { title: "Exact paths, every time", body: "The review sheet lists each full path and how to rebuild it before the destructive button is in reach." },
  { title: "Checked again at delete time", body: "The Rust backend revalidates names and markers right before removal and refuses symlinks and parent traversal." },
];
---

<section class="section" id="safety">
  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <h2>Built to delete. <span class="dim">Never to surprise.</span></h2>
        <p>Removing gigabytes should feel decisive, not risky. The filesystem stays in front of you, and the guardrails live in the backend, where the interface can't talk its way past them.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="guards">
        {
          guards.map((g, i) => (
            <li data-reveal style={`--d:${i}`}>
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="check">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" pathLength="100" />
                <path d="M7.5 12.5l3 3 6-6.5" pathLength="100" />
              </svg>
              <div>
                <b>{g.title}</b>
                <p>{g.body}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="stage" data-reveal style="--d:2" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="sheet" data-spring-tilt="10">
        <b>Remove 2 folders?</b>
        <p>Permanently remove 4.4 GB. Stop builds and dev servers first. Run <code>flutter pub get</code> and reinstall with your package manager before using these projects again.</p>
        <div class="paths">
          <code>~/Developer/atlas-mobile/build</code>
          <code>~/Developer/studio-web/node_modules</code>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <span class="btn">Cancel</span>
          <span class="btn danger">Remove 4.4 GB</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="tag t1">Focus starts on Cancel</span>
      <span class="tag t2">Full paths, never truncated</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .guards {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .guards li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .check {
    color: var(--success);
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .check circle,
  .check path {
    stroke-dasharray: 100;
    stroke-dashoffset: 100;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 900ms var(--ease);
    transition-delay: calc(var(--d, 0) * 120ms + 200ms);
  }
  .check path {
    transition-delay: calc(var(--d, 0) * 120ms + 600ms);
  }
  :global(.is-in) .check circle,
  :global(.is-in) .check path,
  :global(html:not(.js)) .check circle,
  :global(html:not(.js)) .check path {
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
  }
  .guards b {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15.5px;
  }
  .guards p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .stage {
    --rx: 0deg;
    --ry: 0deg;
    position: relative;
    padding: 72px 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    perspective: 900px;
  }
  .sheet {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 26px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--content);
    box-shadow: var(--panel-shadow);
    font-size: 13px;

  }
  .sheet b {
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sheet p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .sheet code {
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .paths {
    margin-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .paths code {
    display: block;
    padding: 9px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .btn {
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--control);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .btn:first-child {
    outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .btn.danger {
    background: #bf332e;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .tag {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--content);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .t1 {
    left: 20px;
    bottom: 28px;
  }
  .t2 {
    right: 20px;
    top: 26px;
    animation-delay: -3s;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .stage {
      padding: 64px 16px;
    }
  }
  @keyframes float {
    from {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateY(4px);
    }
  }
</style>
